Integration rules implemented
Student text is rendered with textContent (NFR-12).
Forms keep their input after a failed save and show error.fields beside each field.
Save is disabled while a write is pending.
Delete asks for confirmation before sending confirmed=true.
Each successful change reloads the list and dashboard and keeps the current filters.
The app refreshes on page focus and once per minute, and a failed refresh keeps the saved data on screen.
